  "title": "Onion and Gruyere Soup",
  "description": "Onions are cooked slowly in butter, then combined with white wine, chicken broth and Gruyere and seasoned with white pepper and nutmeg in this subtle soup.",
  "authors": [
    "Nancy Gregory"
  ],
